[[File:Protection (Beta 33.0).png|thumb|260x260px|Beta 33.0]]
Protection originally costed 1G, but was reduced to 0G and made the user draw a card in '''Beta 5.7''', similar to cards from other souls, such as [[Heal]], [[Poison]], [[Will to Fight]] and [[Penetration]].
[[File:Protection (Beta 41.0).png|thumb|260x260px|Beta 41.0]]
After a long time, Protection got another buff in '''Beta 26.0''', where it gained the ability to also give enemy monsters Taunt. This was reverted in '''Beta 27.0''' due to it being too powerful with [[Small Bird]]. '''Beta 41.0''' increased its cost back to 1G.

'''Beta 55.0''' reworked the soul. Fridge became the new Base spell, while Protection was replaced with [[Frozen Energy]].

